We’re Dodo Pizza. We’re in love with two things: Pizza and Tech. So, we’ve found a way to make the best pizza, make it affordable, and deliver fast.

All our pizzas have crunchy dough, we use fresh vegetables, creamy mozzarella, and a special sauce made from Italian tomatoes and spices. We are fans of quality, cleanliness, and safety and we have nothing to hide!

You can:

— combine pizza halves;

— tailor the recipe according to your preference;

— store the order history and delivery addresses;

— collect a cashback for each order.

Our first pizzeria opened in 2011, now we have over 950 stores in 18 countries such as Vietnam, Nigeria, the United Arab Emirates, Estonia, and a host of other countries. Try us! Download the App and order now.

Please send your suggestions and questions to mobile@dodopizza.com
